                            <p></p><h3>Definition of "k870":</h3><p><b>K870</b> is Neumann&#8217;s designation for the specific variety of K67 capsule found in the U87ai condenser microphone.</p><p>The K870/K67 is a center-terminated design with the characteristic K67 hole pattern in the backplate: notice how a straight line could be drawn in a tangent to the outside ring of holes, connecting 4-6 of the holes.</p><p><img style="text-align: center" src="/images/mic_extras/neumann/neumann_k870_capsule.jpg" width="180" alt="Neumann K870/K67 microphone capsule" /></p>
